## What is Viper?
Viper patches your game's .exe to let you add mods, and gives you a few basic mods to start with. The installer also includes an XBOX emulator, [AnyXboxX](https://github.com/LooperSalty/AnyXboxX)'s build of [VIctory](https://github.com/Marvisak/VIctory), so all you need is your game dump and viper to start playing.
Viper also lets YOU develop mods - just give it to your claude code and start having some fun.

## LEGAL NOTICE
VIper contains no game code, data, executables or keys, and gives no instructions for obtaining
them. You may use ONLY game files that you legally own and dumped YOURSELF, from your own console,
on your own machine. Downloading, sharing or receiving game files, dumps or keys from anyone else
is prohibited and may be illegal. If you cannot meet this condition, do not use VIper. Not
affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Rockstar Games or Take-Two Interactive;
Grand Theft Auto and GTA are their trademarks. Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

## How to Install
1. Download the latest viper from the [releases page](https://github.com/viper-community/viper/releases).
2. Extract the zip.
3. Put `viper.exe` in the game folder (or don't, and then viper will ask you where the game is).
4. Run `viper.exe` (it makes a modded copy of your game's .exe; the original is never changed).
5. Enjoy!

Next time, click `viper.exe` again too.

## Default Mods
1. `viper_trainer`: Spawning vehicles, invincibility, weapons, etc.

